OL,3,ACovid inquiry rejects ministers' claims
OL,4,Aof 'protective ring' around care homes
OL,5,Aat start of pandemic
OL,6,
OL,7,FMinisters' claims of there being a
OL,8,F"protective ring" around care homes at
OL,9,Fthe start of Covid were unfounded,
OL,10,Faccording to the Covid inquiry
OL,12,FBaroness Hallett says the Covid
OL,13,Fpandemic "totally disrupted" the lives
OL,14,Fof people in care homes and had a
OL,15,F"devastating impact"
OL,17,FHer latest report - on the UK's adult
OL,18,Fsocial care sector - says care homes
OL,19,Fseemed "something of an afterthought",
OL,20,Fand patients were moved there from
OL,21,Fhospitals with no early guidance to
OL,22,Fisolate arrivals
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
