OL,3,ACovid inquiry rejects ministers' claims
OL,4,Aof 'protective ring' around care homes
OL,5,Aat start of pandemic
OL,6,
OL,7,FCare workers had to resort to desperate
OL,8,Fmeasures to get PPE, with some using
OL,9,Ffestival waterproof ponchos, painters'
OL,10,Foveralls and bin bags
OL,12,FThe government at the time knew the
OL,13,Fcare sector was "extremely vulnerable"
OL,14,Fto a pandemic but still failed to act
OL,15,Funtil it was too late, a campaigner
OL,16,Ffrom the Covid-19 Bereaved Families for
OL,17,FJustice says
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
