OL,3,ACovid inquiry rejects ministers' claims
OL,4,Aof 'protective ring' around care homes
OL,5,Aat start of pandemic
OL,6,
OL,7,FCurrent Health Secretary Yvette Cooper
OL,8,Fsays the government will respond to the
OL,9,Freport's recommendations and says adult
OL,10,Fsocial care has "for too long been
OL,11,Fundervalued"
OL,13,FThere were more than 43,000 deaths
OL,14,Finvolving Covid in care homes between
OL,15,FMarch 2020 and July 2022
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
