OL,3,AGoogle Cloud says outage affecting
OL,4,Abanks and court video links caused by
OL,5,A'power event'
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoogle says an outage in its Cloud
OL,8,Fservice - which has caused problems for
OL,9,Fcourts, banks, and other businesses
OL,10,Fonline - was caused by a "power event"
OL,12,FOnline bank Revolut, delivery service
OL,13,FDPD and Halifax bank are among the
OL,14,Fbusinesses reporting issues
OL,16,FElsewhere, the courts service says its
OL,17,Fvideo links are affected - the Criminal
OL,18,FBar Association says prosecution and
OL,19,Fdefence barristers in England and Wales
OL,20,F"can not proceed with trials and other
OL,21,Fhearings"
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
