OL,3,AWoman describes alleged assault by
OL,4,ARussell Brand as 'frenzied' and
OL,5,A'violent'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,8,Fcontent
OL,10,FA woman who claims Russell Brand
OL,11,Fsexually assaulted her has described
OL,12,Fthe alleged attack as "frenzied" and
OL,13,F"violent".
OL,15,FBrand, 51, faces seven charges in the
OL,16,Ftrial - three counts of rape, three
OL,17,Fcharges of sexual assault and one of
OL,18,Findecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
