OL,3,ASuspect arrested after historic town
OL,4,Ahall set alight - French media
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suspect linked to a far-left movement
OL,7,Fhas been arrested in France after a
OL,8,F19th Century city hall was gutted by a
OL,9,Ffire over the weekend that broke out
OL,10,Fduring mass disorder, French media
OL,11,Freports.
OL,13,FThe clock tower and parts of the roof
OL,14,Fof the ornate city hall in the central
OL,15,Fcity of Limoges were engulfed in flames
OL,16,Fbefore collapsing on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
